      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://iagenweb.org/mitchell/localdat/ricevill.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Riceville’s public library proudly displays the Brown Opera curtains, original backdrops painstakingly restored and now housed in its community room.",
